பொய்யா","parts":[{"text":"பொய்யா","lemma":"poy","gloss":"unfailing"}],"gloss":"unfailing"},{"surface":"நல்இசை","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good"},{"text":"இசை","lemma":"icai","gloss":"fame"}],"gloss":"good fame"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விரிகதிர்","parts":[{"text":"விரி","lemma":"viri","gloss":"spreading"},{"text":"கதிர்","lemma":"katir","gloss":"rays"}],"gloss":"spreading-rayed"},{"surface":"ஞாயிறு","parts":[{"text":"ஞாயிறு","lemma":"ñāyiṟu","gloss":"sun"}],"gloss":"sun"},{"surface":"விசும்பு","parts":[{"text":"விசும்பு","lemma":"vicumpu","gloss":"sky"}],"gloss":"sky"},{"surface":"இவர்ந்தன்ன","parts":[{"text":"இவர்ந்து","lemma":"ivaru","gloss":"having ascended"},{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"aṉṉa","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like ascended"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சேண்விளங்கு","parts":[{"text":"சேண்விளங்கு","lemma":"சேண்விளங்கு","gloss":"shining far"}],"gloss":"shining far","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"சிறப்பு","lemma":"ciṟappu","gloss":"greatness"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of greatness"},{"surface":"செம்பியர்","parts":[{"text":"செம்பியர்","lemma":"cempiyar","gloss":"Cholas"}],"gloss":"of the Cholas"},{"surface":"மருகன்","parts":[{"text":"மருகன்","lemma":"marukaṉ","gloss":"descendant"}],"gloss":"descendant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொடிநுடங்கு","parts":[{"text":"கொடிநுடங்கு","lemma":"கொடிநுடங்கு","gloss":"banner-waving"}],"gloss":"banner-waving","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"நெடுமா","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"neṭu","gloss":"tall"},{"text":"மா","lemma":"mā","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"tall and great"},{"surface":"வளவன்","parts":[{"text":"வளவன்","lemma":"vaḷavaṉ","gloss":"Valavan"}],"gloss":"Valavan"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தேவர்","parts":[{"text":"தேவர்","lemma":"tēvar","gloss":"gods"}],"gloss":"of the gods"},{"surface":"உலகம்","parts":[{"text":"உலகம்","lemma":"ulakam","gloss":"world"}],"gloss":"world"},{"surface":"எய்தினன்","parts":[{"text":"எய்தினன்","lemma":"eytu","gloss":"he reached"}],"gloss":"he reached"},{"surface":"ஆதலின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆதலின்","lemma":"ātal","gloss":"therefore"}],"gloss":"therefore"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அன்னோர்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னோர்","lemma":"அன்னோர்","gloss":"for such a person"}],"gloss":"for such a person","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கவிக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"கவிக்கும்","lemma":"kavi","gloss":"covering"}],"gloss":"to cover"},{"surface":"கண்ணகன்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"place"},{"text":"அகன்","lemma":"akaṉ","gloss":"wide"}],"gloss":"wide-mouthed"},{"surface":"தாழி","parts":[{"text":"தாழி","lemma":"tāḻi","gloss":"burial urn"}],"gloss":"burial urn"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வனைதல்","parts":[{"text":"வனைதல்","lemma":"vaṉai","gloss":"shaping"}],"gloss":"shaping"},{"surface":"வேட்டனை","parts":[{"text":"வேட்டனை","lemma":"vēḷ","gloss":"you desired"}],"gloss":"you desired"},{"surface":"அயின்","parts":[{"text":"அயின்","lemma":"அயின்","gloss":"if so"}],"gloss":"if so","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"எனையதூஉம்","parts":[{"text":"எனையதூஉம்","lemma":"eṉaiyatu","gloss":"whatsoever"}],"gloss":"in any measure"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இருநிலம்","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"iru","gloss":"vast"},{"text":"நிலம்","lemma":"nilam","gloss":"earth"}],"gloss":"the vast earth"},{"surface":"திகிரியாப்","parts":[{"text":"திகிரியாப்","lemma":"திகிரியாப்","gloss":"as the potter's wheel"}],"gloss":"as the potter's wheel","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெருமலை","parts":[{"text":"பெரு","lemma":"peru","gloss":"great"},{"text":"மலை","lemma":"malai","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"the great mountain"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மண்ணா","parts":[{"text":"மண்","lemma":"maṇ","gloss":"clay"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"as clay"},{"surface":"வனைதல்","parts":[{"text":"வனைதல்","lemma":"vaṉai","gloss":"shaping"}],"gloss":"to shape"},{"surface":"ஒல்லுமோ","parts":[{"text":"ஒல்லுமோ","lemma":"ol","gloss":"is it possible"}],"gloss":"is it possible?"},{"surface":"நினக்கே","parts":[{"text":"நினக்கு","lemma":"niṉakku","gloss":"to you"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"for you indeed?"}]}],"literal":"O potter who makes pots! O potter who makes pots! / Like condensed darkness, the thick mass of dark smoke / reaches the wide, great sky from your kiln, / O potter who makes pots in the wide ancient town! / You are pitiable indeed! What will you do? / With a long, great army that encompassed the limits of the earth, / with unfailing good fame praised by poets, / like the sun with spreading rays ascending the sky, / the descendant of the Cholas of far-shining greatness, / the great Valavan of banner-waving elephants, / has reached the world of the gods, and therefore, / to cover such a person, a wide-mouthed burial urn / you desired to shape; if so, / using the vast earth as your wheel and the great mountain / as your clay, is it possible for you to shape it?","translation":"O potter! O maker of pots! O potter of the wide, ancient town, whose kiln sends up thick, dark smoke like condensed darkness to prop up the wide, great sky! You are indeed to be pitied. What will you do? The descendant of the Cholas of far-shining greatness, who possessed a vast army that reached the ends of the earth, whose unfailing fame was sung by poets, and who shone like the sun with spreading rays ascending the sky—the great Valavan of banner-waving elephants—has reached the world of the gods. Since you have undertaken to shape a wide-mouthed burial urn to cover such a great man, tell me: unless you use the vast earth as your potter's wheel and the great mountain as your clay, is it possible for you to shape it?","modern":"பாண்டங்கள் செய்யும் குயவனே! பாண்டங்கள் செய்யும் குயவனே! இருள் திரண்டது போன்ற கரிய அடர்ந்த புகை, அகன்ற பெரிய வானத்தைத் தொடுமளவுக்குப் புகைக்கும் சூளையைக் கொண்ட, பரந்த பழமையான ஊரின் குயவனே! நீ இரங்கத்தக்கவன்; நீ என்ன செய்வாய்? பூமியின் எல்லை வரை பரவிய நீண்ட பெரிய படையையும், புலவர்கள் புகழ்ந்த பொய்க்காத நல்ல புகழையும் உடையவனும், பரவும் கதிர்களைக் கொண்ட சூரியன் வானத்தில் ஏறியது போன்ற தொலைதூரம் விளங்கும் பெருமை கொண்ட சோழர் மரபினனும், கொடிகள் அசையும் யானைகளை உடையவனுமான நெடுமான் வளவன் தேவருலகத்தை அடைந்துவிட்டான். ஆதலால், அவனுடைய உடலை மூடுவதற்குப் பெரிய அகன்ற வாயைக் கொண்ட ஈமத்தாழியை வனைய விரும்புகிறாய். அவ்வாறாயின், இந்த விரிந்த உலகத்தையே உனது குயவச் சக்கரமாகவும், பெரிய மலையையே உனது மண்ணாகவும் கொண்டு வனைந்தால் ஒழிய, உன்னால் அத்தாழியை வனைய முடியுமோ?","explanation":"The poet Aiyūr Muṭavaṉār addresses a potter who is preparing to make a burial urn for the deceased Chola king, Kiḷḷivalavaṉ. The poet expresses deep grief over the death of the great king. He tells the potter that the king was so immense in his fame, power, and stature that a normal burial urn would never suffice. To make an urn large enough to contain such a great king, the potter would need the entire earth as his wheel and the great mountains as his clay. The poem belongs to the Potuviyal tiṇai and specifically Āṉantap paiyuḷ, which deals with grief and mourning. The hyperbole of using the earth as a wheel and mountains as clay beautifully conveys the overwhelming grief of the poet and the monumental stature of the deceased king.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.83],[0.83,1.4],[1.4,1.69],[1.69,2.57],[2.57,3.0],[3.0,4.02],[4.02,4.9],[4.9,5.63],[5.63,6.36],[6.36,6.94],[6.94,7.23],[7.23,7.96],[7.96,8.54],[8.54,9.27],[9.27,9.56],[9.56,9.88],[9.88,10.1],[10.1,10.5],[10.5,11.2],[11.2,11.6],[11.6,12.05],[12.05,12.5],[12.5,13.15],[13.15,13.64],[13.8,14.6],[14.6,14.9],[14.9,15.2],[15.2,15.5],[15.5,16.8],[16.8,17.13],[17.13,17.56],[17.56,18.0],[18.0,18.58],[18.58,19.27],[19.27,19.84],[19.84,20.44],[20.44,20.84],[20.84,21.94],[21.94,22.64],[22.64,22.94],[22.94,23.63],[23.63,24.14],[24.14,24.54],[24.54,25.19],[25.19,25.54],[25.54,25.9],[25.9,26.34],[26.34,26.74],[26.74,27.24],[27.24,27.79],[27.79,28.34],[28.47,28.74],[28.74,29.01],[29.